#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:736
msgid "A tiny script reports the actual LCP image per template. Once enough samples are collected, the plugin preloads and tags that exact image (foreground or CSS background) instead of guessing — and self-corrects as your site changes."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:740
msgid "Sample rate"
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:743
msgid "Percentage of page views that load the measurement script. Lower = lighter; higher = faster learning. Default: 20%."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:747
msgid "Background-image preload"
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:749
msgid "Preload the hero when the LCP is a CSS background-image (sliders, hero sections)."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:750
msgid "CSS background heroes are a blind spot for most performance plugins — the browser discovers them late. This preloads the measured/manual background URL."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:754
msgid "Loading optimization"
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:756
msgid "Force loading=\"eager\" on the LCP image and loading=\"lazy\" on below-fold images."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:757
msgid "Stops native lazy-loading from delaying your hero, and defers everything below it."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:761
msgid "Visual picker"
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:763
msgid "Prefer to choose manually? On the front end, open the admin-bar menu and click \"Pick LCP element\", then click your hero image. It is saved as a manual override for that template."
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:773
msgid "Per-template LCP targets"
msgstr ""

#: fetchpriority-featured-image.php:776
msgid "What the plugin will prioritise on each template it has seen. \"Auto\" uses a manual pick if set, else the learned LCP, else the featured-image guess."
msgstr ""

